# Lynne
tags: girls, benchmark
stimulus: Strength endurance; every set goes to failure, rest as needed.
score: reps
note: No time component. Each set is taken to failure; score is the total of all bench press and pull-up reps over the five rounds. Rest as needed (2-3 min) between rounds.
5 rounds
  max Bench press @ 1 bw
  max Pull-up
